    "title": "Becky Franzel Shares Journey of Grieving, Healing and Reckoning with 'I Don't Belong Here' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Slowey ,\n11 hours ago Author Becky Franzel’s I Don’t Belong Here: A Year of Moving Forward & Essays on Grief follows her journey of healing, reckoning and recovery following tragedy. Released February 28 via Franzel’s own Aw Shucks Publishing, the book combines her first two titles, This Road Must Go Somewhere and Moving Forward into one cohesive work. “I noticed that when someone bought one book, they would usually buy the other as well,” she says. “It almost felt irresponsible to not have them together.” I Don’t Belong Here is available for purchase online or at Lion’s Tooth (2421 S. Kinnickinnic Ave) in Bay View. Read full article",
